# Deployment ***REMOVED***s — NEVER commit these
.env.deploy
.env.deploy.local
deploy_key
deploy_key.pub
DEPLOYMENT-SECRETS.md

# Canonical ***REMOVED***s folder (AGENTS.md §17) — block everything in
# ***REMOVED***s/local/ but keep the protocol files committed so the team has a
# stable structure. examples/ is committed (only templates, no real values).
***REMOVED***s/local/
***REMOVED***s/local/*
***REMOVED***s/local/.*
!***REMOVED***s/README.md
!***REMOVED***s/.gitkeep
!***REMOVED***s/examples/
!***REMOVED***s/examples/**
# Belt-and-braces: also block every common ***REMOVED*** extension inside the
# folder in case the rules above are bypassed.
***REMOVED***s/**/*.key
***REMOVED***s/**/*.pem
***REMOVED***s/**/*.p12
***REMOVED***s/**/id_rsa*
***REMOVED***s/**/id_ed25519*

# Backup and scratch files
*.backup
scratch.js
tmp-nginx-*.conf
frontend/dist.zip

# AI agent scratch — random per-session files agents create while exploring.
# AGENTS.md forbids committing these; the .gitignore enforces it.
.scratch/
scratch-*.md
.task-*.md
.agent-scratch/
